From f1018c7b9afb9abf5e7eb2864c2d10db97841266 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 23:55:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02705/11362] [outer-loop] Retire TRM Sudoku verifier-graft
 training (operator: "kill it, we don't need it")

TRM is NOT on the live ARC-AGI-3 solve path (that path = Qwen3.5-9B-MTP generator +
LearnedVerifier energy ensemble + graph-explore A*; arc_executable_world_model.py:382
states the proposer is "NOT TRM"). The nano-trm Sudoku-Extreme run was a Phase-3
verifier-graft-v3 probe, now retired for the 2026-06-30 ARC submission sprint.

Killed the detached run (GPU 1 freed) and added a DO_NOT_RELAUNCH sentinel + a guard in
outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py so the hourly watchdog decision-A restart logic cannot resurrect
it. Last checkpoint (val~0.75) left intact; delete the sentinel to re-enable.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 results/trm_runs/DO_NOT_RELAUNCH   | 11 +++++++++++
 scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py |  8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 19 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 results/trm_runs/DO_NOT_RELAUNCH

diff --git a/results/trm_runs/DO_NOT_RELAUNCH b/results/trm_runs/DO_NOT_RELAUNCH
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..002a2744bd
--- /dev/null
+++ b/results/trm_runs/DO_NOT_RELAUNCH
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+TRM Sudoku-Extreme verifier-graft training is RETIRED.
+
+Operator directive 2026-06-18 (overnight ARC sprint): "kill it, we don't need it."
+Rationale: TRM is NOT on the live ARC-AGI-3 generic solve path (that path = Qwen3.5-9B-MTP
+generator + LearnedVerifier energy ensemble + graph-explore A*). The nano-trm Sudoku-Extreme
+baseline was a Phase-3 verifier-graft-v3 research probe, now concluded/deprioritized for the
+2026-06-30 submission sprint.
+
+Effect: scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py refuses to launch while this file exists, so the
+hourly watchdog decision-A restart logic cannot resurrect the run. Delete this file to re-enable.
+Last banked checkpoint: results/trm_runs/sudoku_extreme_baseline/last.ckpt (val~0.75, intact).
diff --git a/scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py b/scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py
index 5188f0ed09..a6221920f0 100644
--- a/scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py
+++ b/scripts/outer_loop_trm_relaunch.py
@@ -67,6 +67,14 @@ def main() -> int:
     )
     args = ap.parse_args()
 
+    # Durable stop: the operator retired the Sudoku-Extreme TRM verifier-graft track (2026-06-18 —
+    # "kill it, we don't need it"; TRM is NOT on the live ARC-AGI-3 solve path). This sentinel makes
+    # the kill survive any watchdog decision-A restart attempt. Delete it to re-enable training.
+    sentinel = REPO_ROOT / "results" / "trm_runs" / "DO_NOT_RELAUNCH"
+    if sentinel.exists():
+        print(f"[relaunch] DO_NOT_RELAUNCH sentinel present ({sentinel}); TRM training is retired. Not launching.")
+        return 0
+
     config = exp4157.Exp4157Config(max_time=args.max_time)
 
     # Refuse to launch a competing run if the trainer is already alive (GPU/checkpoint contention).
-- 
